ind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.25","summary":"Update 0.0.25- Fixed an issue with End Stage Screen not being centered on some resolutions.- Potential Fix for Hang/Crashes.- Added Launch Options / Vulkan / DirectX12 / OpenGL.- Fixed Movement Speed Skill Description.- Fixed an issue with Background Image in Main Menu when skipping intro.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:24:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687232","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846651706685344","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.24","summary":"Update 0.0.24Known Issues:There are issues with setting up resolution, workaround is to close game, restart and do it from main menu.Crash & hangs issues, still looking into it more, let me know if you find and reproduce them!- Improved the Sword Animation.- Improved the Sound Effect of Sword Animation.- Added Sound effects for Roll and Blink.- Replaced Projectile Casting Sound for Monsters.- Lowered Projectile Hit on ground sound.- Added Hit Sound effect to the Melee Attacks of Second Monster, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T19:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685344","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846651706681429","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.23","summary":"Update 0.0.23- Reworked progression of Harvest and Attack skills layout in Skill Tree.- Market Sell Speed can also be unlocked right after Portal.- Reduced the cost of Familiar Ranch Skill from 15k to 10k.- Increased the cost of Mana Restoration Amount skills.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:14:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846651706675307","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.22","summary":"Update 0.0.22- More Main Menu Visuals Updates.- More Ultra Wide support.- Fixed an issue with Inventory UI on lower resolutions.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T18:36:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846018067944441","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.21","summary":"Update 0.0.21- Polished up the Player Sprite.- Changed the Prestige Exp bar to Purple to match with the portal.- Show Stats by default(Turn Off with H)- Changed the names of the language selections to their own country names.- Fixed an issue where Language selection started on English instead of the actual language selected.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:24:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846018067934822","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.20","summary":"Update 0.0.20Remade the target indicators visuals.Added Localization.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T22:16:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846018067929518","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.19","summary":"Update 0.0.19- Default Skill Tree zoom out by about 30% (Developer Note: I've noticed people zoom out all the way anyways, let me know what you think)- Improvements to Tooltip in Skill Tree, will not show on left or right side.- Added visual effect to Prestige Exp and Prestige Leveling.- Added sound effects to bag opening/closing/interaction.- Added Interaction failed. (Developer Note: Let me know if its too much) - No items to add to market. - No gold to pick up. - No inventory space for items ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:50:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929518","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1846018067927520","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.0.18","summary":"Update 0.0.18- Refined the Tutorial a bit more(WIP).- Mana Star reworked(It's a pickup now, you have to interact with)(WIP).- Changed the audio sound for buttons hovered/pressed should be a bit less annoying sounds.- Added red outline and shake effect for health and mana when below 10 points(WIP).- Improved the gold pick up from gold chest.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T20:38:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4483400-1845383656394512","game_id":"steam-4483400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Live Now + Patch Notes!","summary":"If you haven't already please leave me a Steam review, it really helps me